WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.792
Functional Tests. Functional tests check whether an AI workflow behaves as specified.

00:00:06.792 --> 00:00:16.680
Definition. Check inputs, outputs, tool calls, validations, permissions, and expected behavior for representative cases.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:24.504
Think of it like. You do not only admire the appliance; you press the controls and verify the expected result.

00:00:24.504 --> 00:00:33.336
How it works. Include common paths, difficult cases, and risky cases, then check the observable workflow outcome.

00:00:33.336 --> 00:00:41.688
What it is not. A demo can show one limited path; functional tests look for repeatable behavior across cases.

00:00:41.688 --> 00:00:48.096
Remember. Functional evidence is one part of deciding whether an AI system is ready.
